  "description": "I lived to the age of 19, only to be constantly taken advantage of by fake family members. With the vow to seek revenge still fresh in my mind, I made the choice to live my life again. Yet why have I returned to the night I was kidnapped from a burning castle? \n\n\"Hwelp me! Hwelp me! The willian ish twaking Maedie!\" \n\nMy savior ended up being the enemy's son?! For days and nights I followed him to the enemy's castle, but upon arrival, a warm welcome... \n\n\"Ack! Father! Second Brother's picked up another living thing!\" \n\n...wasn't what awaited me. \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated) \n\n*Note: Webcomic prologue of the homonym web novel.*",
